Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:52.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢 你是个家庭主妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. You're a housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿看到我的房子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see my house around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还家庭主妇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们没有妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她在其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might be somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许被吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she got eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个东西都是其他东西的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is food for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.62,0:03:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能表现得再明显点儿不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you be more obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 尽情享用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想用水果封我的口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to buy my silence with fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不止了 还有肉干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. There's also jerky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸为什么要把行尸秘密地关在仓库里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}your dad has a secret barn full of walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这太惊悚了 - 小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's creepy. - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道的 对吧 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know that, right? - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要相信我就行了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trust me on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不擅长说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I suck at lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不能玩扑克牌 跟说谎没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even play poker. It's too much like lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得对这事保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to keep this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须这么做 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 给你些桃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, here's some peaches for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早啊 - 早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没咋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥事也没有 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's up. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书不怎么好看 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not that great, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了 因为没插图么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我感觉糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I feel like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不奢望你能原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect you to forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果有任何我能做的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if there's anything I can do…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是想保护大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were trying to protect the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.60,0:04:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再击中我 你最好祈祷我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoot me again, and you'd best pray I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Rick say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你必须得告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得补充维生素 药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need vitamins, medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要个舒服的枕头\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nice pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的这份也吃了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have my share.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我不想要你的食物 行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I don't want your food, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须得吃东西 你太瘦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to eat. You're too skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不让瑞克照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're not gonna let.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须得让别人照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick take care of you, then someone has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉 你身体有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, you have a medical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再去一次城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make another run into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你还需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to be quiet about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃子男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Peach man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条溪水往南流\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creek flows south,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过达里尔找到的那个农舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}past that farmhouse Daryl found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许索菲亚在这儿掉了娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Sophia dropped the doll there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后顺水往下被冲到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The current brought it downstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 你认为她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you think she.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了这条路然后北上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}took this road here and then she went north?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那条路什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What's up that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个住宅开发区\N{\fnArial\fs30}A housing development.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概十年前就有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went in maybe 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,射击练习完后 去一趟那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a run up there after gun practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责这里 但是你得找个人做后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold down the fort here, but take backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔出了这事后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what went down with daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望任何人单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anyone going out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两人一组\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑找个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take suggestions on a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们在靶场表现如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how they do on the range,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再自己挑人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}then take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的望远镜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My binoculars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想参加今天的射击训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to join you for gun training today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔说的很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel's been very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没经过他同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't involve any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你们任何一人掺和进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in what we do without his okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不喜欢这么做 但还是同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't like it, but he consented.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中只有奥蒂斯会用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis was the only one who knew guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that he's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得学会保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}we gotta learn to protect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爸也是从这方面考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her father saw the sense in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但我得去亲自问问赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but I'll ask Hershel myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 帽子不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, nice lid, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想学射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to learn to shoot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能教我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这个得看你爸妈的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, man, that's… that's up to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能跟他们讲吗 他们会听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you talk to them? They'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你那儿是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see what you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我 我让他进了房车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's my fault. I let him into the R.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他想到处走走 还说你同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he wanted a walkie, that you sent him for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以总的来说 他撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So on top of everything else, he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在想些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想学用枪 他让我教他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to learn how to shoot. He asked me to teach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's none of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很乐意教他 看你们的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm happy to do it. It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not comfortable with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我唱黑脸好吗 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't make me out to be the unreasonable one here. Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我也有顾虑 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I have my concerns too, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么但是 他才刚受了枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no but. He was just shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚复原 现在却想拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just back on his feet and he wants a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比他怕枪好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than him being afraid of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,营地里有枪是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are guns in camp for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得学会怎样安全使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should learn to handle them safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想我儿子拿着枪到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want my kid walking around with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么辩解这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how can you defend that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他没保护措施就到处乱走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't let him go around without protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要一直待这儿就很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's as safe as he'll ever be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, everything you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有道理 但感觉不妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes perfect sense. It feels wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 之前他跟着你去林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I didn't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就有不祥的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}about him following you out into the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我当时会说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish I'd said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该坚持的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've gone with my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长大了 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's growing up, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他当成年人对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to start treating him more like an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他也得表现得像个成年人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he needs to act like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不够成熟来用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not mature enough to handle a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拿着玩的 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna play with it, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪不是玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I disappointed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想去找索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want to look for Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想保护我们的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want to defend our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用枪我没法做到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that without a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩是我所知道最好的教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane's the best instructor I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过他教比卡尔还小的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen him teach kids younger than Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要认真对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为自己的行为负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will behave responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何一个人和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I hear from anyone in this camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了我们不希望你做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're not living up to our expectations…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会让你失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要这么做 就得听肖恩的指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you're gonna do this, you listen to Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 爸爸 - 好吗 要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, dad. - All right? You be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来吗 - 我得去帮戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You coming? - I gotta help Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理房车上的火花塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}clean the spark plugs on the R.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要给我讲讲机械原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he's gonna teach me mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should probably go look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,火花塞 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spark plugs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,想告诉我怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你年长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,经验丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're… you know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人告诉你某件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if somebody told you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事另一个人应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that somebody else should know…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 别吞吞吐吐的 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, stop being dramatic. Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷仓里有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's… there's walkers in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有洛莉怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lori's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 老兄别打的那么烂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, man. Don't give me that gangsta shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别灰心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会打中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll hit the target eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我没打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I didn't hit my target?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这把 要沉一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this one. It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,更容易平衡 两次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get better balance, twice the rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她掌握门道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say she's got the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,够格学习高级课程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say she's ready for the advanced class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人回去之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再开始训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the rest of us head back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉如何 - 我喜欢它的重量\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it feeling? - I like the weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定不走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you decided not to leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变主意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打中了 - 非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - That's a great shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼奈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nervous Nelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它自己回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She find her way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上在它的马圈里发现了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found her in her stall this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love your fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我走了很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a long walk this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后走到了谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ended up by the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了行尸的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the moans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你保守这个秘密肯定有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you have your reasons for keeping this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,广播停止前 我一直在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the broadcasts before they stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了人们疯狂的恐惧 残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}saw the irrational fear, the atrocities,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在我井边发生的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the incident at my well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打死了一个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We put down a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看的广播和我看的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you watched the same broadcasts I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该看到行尸在袭击人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw walkers attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,残杀人类 他们很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill. They're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,偏执性精神病也很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}A paranoid schizophrenic is dangerous too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不杀害病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't shoot sick people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不了解外面的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are cut off from the outside world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼见过我在乎的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've seen people that I cared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}die and come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're not people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子和继子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife and stepson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那个谷仓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}are in that barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和瑞克谈谈的 他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll speak to Rick. He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:14:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以加固谷仓 让大家更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make the barn more secure, keep everybody safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷仓很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The barn is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想帮忙的话 不要告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep this to yourself if you want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克心地善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is a man of conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你确定所有你们的人都是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but are you so sure about everyone in your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你孩子恢复得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it your boy did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真应该庆幸自己没有女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be grateful you don't have a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是所有的事都像想去射击一样简单就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only things were as simple as wanting to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔有这样的机会 多亏了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl's getting that chance, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远感激你对我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和盛情款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what you did and your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会干好我们的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll earn our keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感谢 但是卡尔身体越来越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that, but with Carl getting better,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们也该动身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine you'll be moving on soon…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你们要去本宁堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort Benning, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没中 - 目标太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still a virgin. - The target's too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别废话 半小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, that's crap. Half-hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼见你射中了25尺外的靶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you nail a bull's-eye at 25'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个目标静止不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为行尸会站在那里等你打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think a walker's gonna hold still for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心点 装上子弹 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus and reload, go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你生气了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh, did I piss you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 姑娘 你周围都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girl, you've got walkers all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,树林里 房车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the woods. They're in the R.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的不只是螺丝刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need more than a damn screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别扰乱我 - 你太情绪化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop badgering me. - You're too damn emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得关闭自己的感觉 不要内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to shut it down. Take all that guilt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要恐惧 不要生气 统统不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}take that fear, that being pissed off, take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, 'cause you're so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗 我可以很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that? See, I can be pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哼着迪克西（南北战争时期南方的战歌）也能打中目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be whistling "Dixie" and I'll always hit the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你 老天 就像个小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, god, you shoot like a damn girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在这 拿枪指着行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand here and you point your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像用你自己的手一样 什么都不要想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point like you point your finger. Do not think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是肌肉记忆 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about muscle memory, girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muscle memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着来 快打那个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go on, shoot that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过来了 离你只有10尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming for you! He's 10 feet away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,9尺 只有5尺远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's 9 feet… he's 5 feet away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那 就是那个行尸抓到了艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there, that's the walker that got Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打那个王八蛋 快打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you shoot that son of a bitch! Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔想让我们离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel expects us to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人知道这件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody else know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你打算告诉我吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were you gonna tell me? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候 你知道多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When? How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没多久 你不用担心这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long. You don't need to worry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能不担心 这是我们的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you expect me not to worry? We have shelter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有食物供给 还有医生照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and food and water and medical care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和赫谢尔说过了 这不是板上钉钉的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been talking with Hershel. It's not carved in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都习惯这的生活了 他们会吓坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are settling in here. They'll be devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我在处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我可以和他谈谈 求求情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can talk to him too and plead our case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是那么简单 现在我们能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, things are uneasy. The best thing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是给赫谢尔留些空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to give Hershel some space.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你很害怕 你不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're scared. Like you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人这样我能接受 但你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take it from everyone else, but not from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand how you could keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你为什么要瞒着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}something like this from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔刚能下床 索菲亚也还没有找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl's barely on his feet. And Sophia's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔和T仔都受了伤 我们怎么能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Daryl and T-dog are hurt. How can we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想离开这 但是如果我们必须得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what I want either, but if we have to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎样我都要保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do whatever it takes to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和卡尔没事再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and carl are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:18:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会挺过去 会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get by. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.85,0:18:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来吧 让我载你一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let me give you a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脚好的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}My feet work just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想吓吓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just trying to get you rattled,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱世浮萍是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it's like when the shits starts to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是道歉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该提起艾米 我越线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I crossed the line when I brought amy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是在向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你就是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real dick sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I acknowledge that. I'll tell you what:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到个关于索菲亚的线索 准备去查看下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a lead on sophia. I'm gonna go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:19:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起去 做我的后援怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come with me, be my backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子曾经有过一次身孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife was pregnant once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果流产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She miscarried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们就没再试过要孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we didn't try again after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我记得最清楚的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that I remember most.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一闻到肉味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is how nauseated she became.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会觉得无比恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the smell of cooking meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子可是最喜欢吃肉的人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was a meat-eating gal… my wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而一怀孕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with the pregnancy…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个感恩节\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thanksgiving,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.31,0:20:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,火鸡的味道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The turkey…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整两天她都不能待在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't be in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到味儿都散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For two days until it was aired out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是格伦告诉你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁 这娃可没有坏心眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect? The boy has no guile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没告诉瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和肖恩有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of Shane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么明显吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it that obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, I don't think anyone knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't, not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我丈夫死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I thought my husband was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时觉得自己好像和他一起死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I felt like I died with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找到活着的感觉 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to feel something… anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.67,0:21:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是现在我恨死自己这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I hate myself for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也恨肚里的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子是瑞克的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Rick's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这点其他的都没什么意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the rest of it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么还担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what's your concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是回忆让我继续坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memories are what keep me going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去生活的那些美好记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memories of what life used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有半辈子的美好记忆支撑着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a deep well to draw on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得欢乐的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still remember joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是恐怕卡尔已经没什么可回忆的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think carl's well is already running dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而肚里的这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它根本就不会有美好的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby won't have any good memories at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.37,0:21:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有恐惧和疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only fear and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍然能找到欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still find joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然能从彼此的身上找到力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can still take strength from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为这个孩子能有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think this baby has a chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,长大成人并且过上幸福快乐的生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it could grow up and live a happy life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look me in the eye and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子能够活到你这把年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That my baby will grow up to be your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.76,0:22:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且快乐的离开这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And die happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊 告诉我你坚信这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. Tell me you believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我 说漏了嘴 好在是戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm… it just came out. And it was dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我不该让你为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I never should have put you in that position.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我需要帮助的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About needing help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 我真的需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.20,0:22:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮什么忙都行 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还愿意为我进次城\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're still willing to make a run into town for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随叫随到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.91,0:22:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气 小菜一碟 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's not a big deal really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以远距离恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could hate me from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你开开金口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 我… - 我让你信任我 你却背叛了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie, I… - I asked for your trust and you betrayed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.74,0:23:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我爸生我的气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now my dad's pissed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸认为他们生病了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your dad thinks they're sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认同这种说法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You agree with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在井边事件之后还这么认为吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after what you saw at the well?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定当时在井边看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what I saw at the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.13,0:23:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你去过亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you'd seen Atlanta,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.14,0:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不会圈一谷仓的行尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would not have a barn full of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.37,0:23:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能停止这么叫他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd stop calling them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么称呼他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.81,0:23:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.71,0:23:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.99,0:23:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,费希尔先生 费希尔太太 莱茜 邓肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. And mrs. Fischer, Lacey, Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这次又想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.33,0:24:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以当他们中的一个人让你保密时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when one of them asks you to keep your mouth shut…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别墨迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crawl out of my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.53,0:24:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧帮我找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help me look, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩我呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.49,0:25:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.13,0:25:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.88,0:25:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 - 格伦 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie! - Glenn, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄走 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它伤着你了吗 咬到你没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it get you? Did it bite you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.37,0:26:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得挨家挨户找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to go house to house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.77,0:26:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从最远一家开始 然后往回找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start at the far end and we'll work our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.67,0:26:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是索菲亚能走到这 活着的机会就很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Sophia got this far, she has a real shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.76,0:26:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.77,0:27:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们拿到了你要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! We got your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.87,0:27:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 等下 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, hang on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.62,0:27:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到里面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.67,0:27:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 别藏着掖着 你的特快专递在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Nothing to hide. We got your special delivery right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.11,0:27:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的乳液 护发素\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got your lotion, got your conditioner,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.55,0:27:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的肥皂剧杂志 - 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your soap opera digest. - Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.95,0:27:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你想要什么东西 你他妈的自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you want something, get it your damn self.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不是你跑腿的 - 亲爱的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not your errand boys. - Honey, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.41,0:27:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这是你的打胎药\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's your abortion pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.15,0:27:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那件事做的不太对 - 哪件事不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was not cool. - Which part?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个贱人差点让我俩送命的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The part where that bitch almost got us killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.01,0:27:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've gone alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想怪谁的话 就怪我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to blame anybody, blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.81,0:27:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 把错揽到自己身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, take the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 作为一个聪明人你真是笨到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a smart guy, you're really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.45,0:27:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我有点糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm confused,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.23,0:27:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我以为你刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think you just.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:28:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,称赞了我 可是听起来又\N{\fnArial\fs30}paid me a compliment, but you made it s…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.97,0:28:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经失去了这世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already lost three of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.34,0:28:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最在乎的三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I care about most in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.24,0:28:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie… - shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.69,0:28:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人聪明 又勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart. You're brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.46,0:28:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个领袖 但是你自己不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a leader. But you don't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.93,0:28:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的朋友不想知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your friends don't want to know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.63,0:28:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们更愿意让你去找桃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd rather have you fetching peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,井里有个行尸 让格伦下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a dead guy in the well? Send glenn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是钓行尸的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're walker bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.29,0:28:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看你变成像他们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take you becoming one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.33,0:28:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.94,0:28:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用墙把走廊隔开了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They walled off the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.21,0:29:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尝试留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to make a stand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.35,0:29:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.92,0:30:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was never here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.49,0:30:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.66,0:30:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知该怎么告诉卡萝尔线索又断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to tell Carol this was another dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.96,0:30:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责街上的行尸 我负责车周围的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover that street. I'll clear the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.81,0:30:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.86,0:30:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精神 把枪弄好 集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus now. Clear the jam. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.34,0:31:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开什么玩笑啊 - 有我呢 放心杀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you kidding me? - I got your back. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚 安德莉亚 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, Andrea, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.57,0:31:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.57,0:31:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.77,0:31:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬衣服上有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood on Maggie's shirt…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.66,0:31:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事吧 情况严重吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys all right? How bad was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.48,0:31:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,险些没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.61,0:31:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.16,0:31:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该叫你去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have asked you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.35,0:32:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为镇里很安全 可如果你们回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the town was safe, but if you hadn't come back…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.53,0:32:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们回来了 我总能脱险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we did. I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些紧急避孕药有效吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The morning-after pills… will they even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.05,0:32:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是否希望它们有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know if I want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.30,0:32:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还弄了些这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I got these too,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.12,0:32:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.92,0:32:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,产前维生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prenatal vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.22,0:32:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事太难决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hell of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.75,0:32:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我不用想这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.53,0:32:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉 我们是朋友 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, we're friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.27,0:32:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这么多 我们当然是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything we've been through… yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.54,0:32:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法教你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.82,0:32:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事我没法教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never tell you something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.19,0:33:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your choice…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.99,0:33:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不该私自下决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you shouldn't make it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.11,0:33:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.15,0:33:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来 快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here. Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.44,0:35:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.78,0:35:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天会搜索更多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll cover more ground tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.38,0:35:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们碰上什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.11,0:35:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.91,0:35:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那地方丧尸暴走了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The place was overrun. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.06,0:35:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去洗洗干净吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get you cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.09,0:35:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, shane,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.17,0:35:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 你给自己弄了台新车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking, you've got that nice new ride of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.95,0:35:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,装满了油 足够让你远走高飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}plenty of fuel, more than enough for you to get far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.68,0:35:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你要我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you telling me to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.04,0:35:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有此计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've been planning to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.78,0:35:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许现在正是时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe now is a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.93,0:36:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为安德莉亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.90,0:36:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了大家着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking out for the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.06,0:36:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔 你觉得没了我 大家会过得更好是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the group would be better off without me, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.67,0:36:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不跟瑞克和洛莉说去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell that to Rick or Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.19,0:36:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是老子 他们的儿子早没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their boy would be dead if I hadn't put my ass on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.77,0:36:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Otis's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.38,0:36:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对那晚发生的事一直含糊其辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been vague about that night, about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.90,0:36:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂斯是英勇牺牲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis died a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.26,0:36:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.21,0:36:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是那晚的牺牲 才挽救了一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little boy lived because of what went down that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该心存感恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you ought to show some gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.83,0:36:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当时不在场 - 是啊 你根本不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't there. - No, man, you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.14,0:36:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你用枪指着瑞克时 我可看得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was the time that you raised your gun on Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.73,0:36:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 老天 - 你清楚地看到是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Jesus. - You had him in your sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.06,0:36:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却用枪指着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you held him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.56,0:36:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what kind of man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.20,0:36:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会朝瑞克开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd shoot Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.18,0:36:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.82,0:36:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱这兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the man that I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.97,0:37:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像爱自己的亲兄弟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love him like he's my a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.34,0:37:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是那种人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's the kind of man I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.29,0:37:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.47,0:37:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也许我们得想想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we ought to just think that through.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.10,0:37:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说我是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say I'm the kind of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.29,0:37:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,会杀自己最好的朋友的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd gun down his own best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.69,0:37:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不喜欢的人开始指控我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I'd do to some guy that I don't even like.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.82,0:37:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he starts throwing accusations my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.70,0:37:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.49,0:38:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么事需要告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something you need to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.72,0:38:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能走 我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave. I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.03,0:38:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吐出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管骂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can yell if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.74,0:38:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想喊就喊出来吧 但请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can scream if you have to, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.10,0:38:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.47,0:38:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.47,0:39:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要紧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.96,0:39:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天吗 几周吗 你却瞒着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Days? Weeks? And you didn't tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.10,0:39:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正要告诉你 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm telling you now. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.17,0:39:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了这些药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found these.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.80,0:39:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 格兰知道 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So glenn knows, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.66,0:39:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他去弄药 而不是来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of going to me, you sent him to get pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.86,0:39:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我慌了 因为你说我们现在居无定所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I panicked. You tell me we have no roof and no walls…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not put this on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.70,0:39:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冲我发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tear into me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.58,0:39:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你守着这秘密 还吃这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping secrets when you're holding onto this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.15,0:39:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让孩子生在这种环境下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to bring a baby into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.43,0:39:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他茹毛饮血 朝不保夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}To live a short, cruel life?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you think like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.20,0:39:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连现有的孩子都保护不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't even protect the son we already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.48,0:39:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就这么解决吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.47,0:39:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我都吐出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I threw them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.82,0:39:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.11,0:39:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how we do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.56,0:40:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.50,0:40:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做 你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? Tell me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.27,0:40:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想出办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.15,0:40:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们不该试着想办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we try to figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.85,0:40:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把药吐出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You threw up the pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.59,0:40:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想保住孩子 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want this baby. I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.26,0:40:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不能像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.06,0:40:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这荒郊野岭生下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not giving birth in a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.79,0:40:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他打娘胎里出来就朝不保夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when its life will hang by a thread from the second it's born.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.24,0:40:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他的每一声哭泣都把他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when every cry will put it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把卡尔 把所有我们关心的人都置于险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Carl, and everyone we care about, in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.64,0:40:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.76,0:40:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可也不能剥夺他生存的机会啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even giving it a chance isn't right either.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.01,0:40:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是为什么我不想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is why I didn't want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.99,0:40:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是 还是不明白为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still… I still don't understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得我会逼你生孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'd make you have a baby you don't want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.55,0:40:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果我真的把胎儿打掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, so that if I went through with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.68,0:40:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,良心受谴责的就是我 而不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be on my conscience and not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.87,0:40:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许确实如此 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's true, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.54,0:41:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再这么生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't live like this anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.94,0:41:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.93,0:41:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能这么生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't live like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.34,0:41:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么别的事要告诉我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else I should know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.52,0:41:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.75,0:41:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Of course I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.48,0:41:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.17,0:41:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界操蛋了 你以为我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world went to shit and you thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.09,0:41:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.20,0:42:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
